class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Servants' Quarters\">Servants' Quarters</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-473&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-7</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[Interwoven prayers and incantations snake across one side of the page. Written on the other are instructions for performing the <a href=\"/wiki/Rite_of_Thorns_(ritual)\" title=\"Rite of Thorns (ritual)\">Rite of Thorns</a>. When the prayer is complete, thorns and bramble rise from the earth, protecting from harm all who chanted it.]\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>See also:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grove_Artefacts\" title=\"Grove Artefacts\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/eb/DEC_Druids_Tablet_Stone_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Grove_Artefacts\" title=\"Grove Artefacts\">Grove Artefacts</a></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_Quests\">Related Quests</span></h